        "name": "食谱：白灵果派",
        "desc": "<p>步骤详实的食谱，记载着「白灵果派」的制作方法。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/07/21/9cdbd4c12d8b09d21f658dff3b243948_3146573138898212062.png",
